{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2023-02-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'KEN ROBINSON ELECTED TO OCCIDENTAL BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'HOUSTON, FEB. 22, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- OCCIDENTAL (NYSE:OXY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT KEN ROBINSON, WHO CURRENTLY SERVES ON THE BOARDS OF DIRECTORS FOR ABERCROMBIE & FITCH, PAYLOCITY AND MORGAN STANLEY U.S. BANKS, AND FORMERLY SERVED AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF AUDIT AND CONTROLS AT EXELON CORPORATION, HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE AS OF FEBRUARY 16, 2023.'}